ns separate |\ndocs/planning/status.md:81:| C43 | **Reviewed at 9** (P09, D059): actual Codex attempt-02 scored **9/9/9/9/9**, no required fixes, blockers or evidence gaps; branch integrated in main | `reviews/C43/attempt-02/verdict-returned.json`; complete available historical packets/runs preserved for Worf. New P09 cumulative qualification remains separate |\ndocs/planning/status.md:82:| C44 | **Reviewed at 9 and merged** (P09, D059): attempt-05 scored **9/9/9/9/9**, no required fixes, blockers or evidence gaps; post-review strict/hash/native audit passed. Evidence commit `4767bf14`, main merge `eef1bf98`; all 34 owner modifications preserved | `reviews/C44/attempt-05/receipt.json`; P09 integrated checks/native evidence and phase review remain separate gates |\ndocs/planning/status.md:84:## C01 evidence (docs/planning/evidence/C01)\ndocs/planning/status.md:119:(owner-approved; main untouched). At that C01 checkpoint no product endpoint had been called and no signing/live/installed qualification had run. Current L19/C26 history and remaining gates are described in WORF-START-HERE.md.\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:1:# Behavioral and native test catalogue\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:9:## Core authority and SDK\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:39:## Presentation and Academy\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:44:- **T09 Native UI:** actual Tauri command path, menus/shortcuts, keyboard-only\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:61:## Workflows and Harness\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:86:## Import, quality, and artifacts\ndocs/planning/test-catalogue.md:120:## Performance budget governance\ndocs/planning/parity-matrix.md:1:# Working-v1 parity and release closure\ndocs/planning/parity-matrix.md:36:## Required per-workflow ledger\ndocs/planning/parity-matrix.md:59:## Intentional non-goals and retained classifications\ndocs/planning/dependencies.md:1:# Dependency and source gates\ndocs/planning/dependencies.md:8:## Source ownership\ndocs/planning/dependencies.md:27:##