s/planning/decisions.md:275:## D026 — Codex independent review of every chunk and phase\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:307:## D027 — Published scm-sdk crate as the scan SDK input\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:329:## D028 — Academy device sign-in over the app-owned client, not oauth2/openidconnect\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:353:## D029 — Desktop learner host: Academy's own pages with declared host capabilities\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:376:## D030 — Graded workflows through Academy's contracts; host capabilities for what the desktop leaves to the web\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:413:## D031 — Offline work sealed per account with a lazily created Keychain key\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:452:## D032 — Owner acceptance of a review below 9/10\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:473:## D033 — Management reads through the published SDK's `management` feature\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:507:## D034 — Chunk reviews at 8/10; phase sign-off at 9/10 with every chunk raised\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:529:## D035 — Reviewed Runtime writes with an AppKit confirmation and secret sheet\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:569:## D036 — DLP authoring subset with staged keyword files\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:603:## D037 — Sessions investigations, the protected cache and metadata-only reports\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:645:## D038 — Case Library storage and Runtime Home/Inbox scope\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:698:## D039 — Red Team and Model/skill observation scope and reads\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:764:## D040 — API Client projects and documents (local-first authoring)\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:864:## D041 — API Client execution and managed-request admission (ADR 0004)\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:995:## D042 — Gateway workspace and configuration reads\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1060:## D043 — Reviewed Gateway changes and provisioning outcomes\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1180:## D044 — Gateway inference, observation and Home/Inbox\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1283:## D045 — Playground APIs and Gateway files: chat completions, Responses and a bounded file subset\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1364:## D046 — The native Harness engine: sealed resource, lifecycle and the C19 conversation\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1498:## D047 — Harness company sign-in, renewal and protected history\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1711:## D048 — Harness desktop tools, project folder, approvals and proposals\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1838:## D049 — Workspace MCP servers for the Harness: catalog, desktop OAuth, grants and approval\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:1997:## D050 — Reviewed v1 import: source contract, mapping, receipts and rollback\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2213:## D051 — Local redacted diagnostics: typed events, retention, export and reset\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2276:## D052 — C25 scope reduction: Gateway workspace provisioning (W37, W39)\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2298:## D053 — C25 scope reduction: five blocked live checks\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2313:## D054 — scm-sdk 0.2.4\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2324:## D055 — C25 review attempt-01: deferrals and a waived cleanup\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2344:## D056 — Academy live follow-ups move to 2.1.0; stable is 2.0.0\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2363:## D057 — C26 attempt 01: installed-acceptance defects and the Git rule\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2391:## D058 — UI v2 \"Refined Native\": frozen prototype, P09 extraction plan\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2393:Accepted by the owner on 2026-10-26 (\"I accept it as written\"), with authority to implement P09 end to end autonomously and to proceed with C28 while C26 remains in progress; every chunk is reviewed until it scores 9 in every dimension.\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2407:   phase P09 chunks C27–C34 (see the chunk index). The first implementation\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2438:   at 100%/200% in both themes per chunk. Live calls only in C29 (verify,\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2443:   C28–C34 follow D034.\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2446:   redacted wire data; English only in P09; chunks commit on main except C34.\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2448:   C28 waits for C26.\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2451:## D059 — P09 re-cut: port the prototype, one gate per screen at 8\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2458:- The frozen prototype (D058, version 134) is the specification per screen; the\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2474:  over the existing state machine, C44 legacy removal on a branch and the P09\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2477:## Directions explicitly requested before round 1\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2490:## Interview exit and remaining evidence\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2502:## D060 — No import from the alpha; this desktop is v1\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2507:- Still to decide the same way, in a follow-up chunk the owner names (proposed C45): the core's alpha-import intents and reader (`import_v1_domain`, the `V1Import*` intents, the host adapters), Settings' file-based \"Import tenant profiles\" and the API Client's \"Import v1 API Client profile\" adoption, which are alpha-import surfaces too; their removal changes contracts and earlier chunks' tests and is not done inside the P09 closure.\ndocs/planning/decisions.md:2508:- Naming: this desktop becomes v1 and the previous one the alpha. The rename touches the application identity that lets the two coexist (bundle identifiers, data roots, Keychain namespaces, D001-era identities) and the whole document set; it is its own chunk after P09, not a find-and-replace.\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:1:# Prisma AIRS Desktop v2 implementation plan\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:8:## Outcome and exclusions\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:25:## Architectural guiding principles\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:59:## Ordered phases and chunks\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:80:| P09   | C27–C44  | UI v2 \"Refined Native\": spec, shell, wizard, destinations (D058); re-cut from C35 as one screen per chunk ported from the prototype (D059) |\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:82:### G00 — Plan confirmation\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:91:### G01 — Architecture improvement workflow\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:104:## Per-chunk execution contract\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:131:## Command contract to establish in C01\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:153:## Coverage and evidence\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:172:## Expected sequencing dependencies\ndocs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:190:## Completion and delivery\ndocs/architecture/toolchain.json\ndocs/architecture/shared-lifecycle.json\ndocs/architecture/DESIGN.md\ndocs/architecture/budgets.json\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/tokens.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/DESIGN-V2.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/README.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/shell.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/academy.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/administration-inventory.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/harness.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/inbox-reads.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/reviews-administration.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/boards.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/wizard.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/api-client-test-cases.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/R2Onboard.dc.html\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/R2Rationale.dc.html\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/R2Harness.dc.html\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/R2App.dc.html\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/R2Harness2.dc.html\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/R2Harness3.dc.html\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/MANIFEST.sha256\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/provenance.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/invariants.md\ndocs/architecture/ui-v2/state-ownership.md\ndocs/architecture/native-acceptance.md\ndocs/architecture/checks.json\ndocs/architecture/review-verdict.schema.json\ndocs/architecture/live-manifest.template.json\ndocs/architecture/notice-inventory.json\ndocs/architecture/inputs.lock.json\ndocs/architecture/workflows.md\ndocs/architecture/workflow-ledger.json\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json\ndocs/architecture/qualification.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
