-N01\"], \"a failing client is reported by the wizard's checks with Fix and verify again; the scan key stands apart\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:204:    \"C13-N06\": (X, [\"C39-N03\", \"C43-N01\"], \"the observation products are Read-only (their tags) and offer no workflow control; only reads reach the plane\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:317:    \"C28-N05\": (X, [\"C43-N02\"], \"a toast after the sheet closes; a refused navigation's toast: apps/desktop/src/v2 tests\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:320:    # ---- C29 wizard → C43 ----\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:321:    \"C29-N01\": (X, [\"C43-N01\"], \"Welcome with its cards and no Back, retained after relaunch; Set up a tenant (the C43 setup rail replaces the earlier rail-free welcome)\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:322:    \"C29-N02\": (X, [\"C43-N01\"], \"validation, drafting, scan/client custody, editing the draft without losing its key, Gateway workspace listing/choice and inference-key setup\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:323:    \"C29-N03\": (X, [\"C43-N01\"], \"product cards and actual rejected-client verification, editable credential correction, workspace re-choice and passing verification; a product edit marks the run stale and closes Continue until a clean rerun\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:324:    \"C29-N04\": (X, [\"C43-N01\"], \"Starter cases, Academy, Done and Open Prisma AIRS completing once, imported Runtime cases in Test Cases, followed by a relaunch to Home\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:325:    \"C29-N05\": (X, [\"C43-N02\"], \"the topmost add-tenant modal; Cancel before a draft and after storing a draft scan key, unchanged tenant rows/active tenant and actual Keychain record removal; Finish commits exactly once\"),\ntools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py:326:    \"C29-N06\": (X, [\"C43-N03\"], \"all seven first-run and five add-tenant ste